title: "Promo Optimization Engine"
abstract: >-
  Causal promo uplift estimation (Double ML) feeding a 0-1 integer program
  (OR-Tools CP-SAT) that builds a promo calendar maximising incremental margin,
  served as a FastAPI service. Built on dunnhumby "The Complete Journey".
